WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.068
♪ (SYMPHONY MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.272 line:0%
Hello. I'm Chukwudi Iwuji,
and I will be playing the role

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:09.876 line:0%
of Clemson Murn in
the HBO Max series,<i> Peacemaker.</i>

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.744
I made a vow to have peace
at any cost,

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.447
no matter how many men,
women, and children
I need to kill to get it.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.951
Good. 'Cause right now,
the world needs a son of a bitch

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.419
and you're the only one I got.

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:22.722
Today, I'll be preparing
for the role

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:26.125
with dramatic readings of
some of the most iconic scenes

00:00:26.191 --> 00:00:27.761
in DC Comics' history.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.597 line:0%
<i> "Alfred hates it...</i>

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.937
...but he loves the coffee."

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:46.112
"...Black Lantern."

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:57.057
"This takes hard work!"

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.128 line:0%
<i> "...'You're done!'"</i>

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:11.804
"...I had a bladder spasm."

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.075 line:0%
<i> "You're saying
 you wet your pants?"</i>

00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:17.477
(SNORTS)

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.346
(LAUGHS)

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.853
(MIMICS ELECTRICAL DISCHARGE)

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.354
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:33.159
<i> "Every job I pull
 will involve pennies.</i>

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:38.364
My crime symbol
will be pennies!"

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.867
This is the most fun
I've ever had.

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:52.344
This has been dramatic
comic book readings

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.680
with Chukwudi Iwuji.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:55.448
Thank you for joining me

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:58.284
for this exercise
in the art of acting,

00:01:58.317 --> 00:01:59.219
and I beseech you,

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.655
<i> don't miss my turn
 as Clemson Murn on</i> Peacemaker.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:03.690
Any questions?

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.226
Only on HBO Max.

